  "description": "Rule-based financial reconciliation engine for .NET. Match your ledger against processor settlement files, bank statements against internal books, invoices against payments: exact composite keys, amount tolerance (absolute or percentage), date windows with direction control, one-to-many gross-vs-net grouping, and aging of unmatched items. Deterministic, decimal-safe, zero external dependencies.",
